Package: openlf2
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Laserlicht <Laserlicht@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://openlf2.github.io/OpenLF2/
Depends: @DEPENDS@, ca-certificates
Description: Scriptable reimplementation of Little Fighter 2
 OpenLF2 uses a C++23 engine with Lua gameplay and UI scripts.
 The original Little Fighter 2 v2.0a installer must be supplied separately.
 No original game assets are included in this package.
